abstract: >-
  Exploratory evaluation of representation-induced false authorization in a simulated
  multi-stage GPT-6 Astra planning pipeline. The study examines how loss of safety-critical
  attributes at component boundaries can change downstream classification and authorization,
  and tests safety-metadata preservation and mandatory revalidation as mitigations.
